eal.le_of_less_left (by { linarith [h\u2083] }) h\u2082]\n            exact (by\n              linarith [h\u2080, h\u2081, h\u2082, h\u2083]\n            ))\n        ))\n    )\n  )\n", "cold": "reject", "lean_seconds": 4.0, "verdict": "accept", "fixes": [], "closers": ["linarith"], "chain_seconds": 15.9, "lane": "mistral-ministral-3b-2512", "try_id": "39a07c42e2ba", "answer_id": "a1f2a4e19ba0"}
